{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(n):\n    \"\"\"Check if n is a Woodall number (n * 2^n - 1 for some positive integer n).\"\"\"\n    if n < 1:\n        return False\n    \n    # Try different values of k to see if n = k * 2^k - 1\n    k = 1\n    while k * (2 ** k) - 1 <= n:\n        if k * (2 ** k) - 1 == n:\n            return True\n        k += 1\n    return False"}
