{"task_id": "Mbpp/67", "solution": "def bell_number(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate the nth Bell number using dynamic programming triangle method.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Create triangle where each row starts with last element of previous row\n    triangle = [[1]]\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        row = [triangle[i-1][-1]]  # Start with last element of previous row\n        for j in range(len(triangle[i-1])):\n            row.append(row[j] + triangle[i-1][j])\n        triangle.append(row)\n    \n    return triangle[n][0]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/67", "solution": "def bell_number(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth Bell number using Bell's triangle.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Create Bell's triangle\n    bell = [[0 for i in range(n+1)] for j in range(n+1)]\n    bell[0][0] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(1, n+1):\n        bell[i][0] = bell[i-1][i-1]\n        for j in range(1, i+1):\n            bell[i][j] = bell[i-1][j-1] + bell[i][j-1]\n    \n    return bell[n][0]"}
