{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "def is_Diff(num):\n    # Convert to string to easily access digits\n    str_num = str(abs(num))\n    \n    # Calculate alternating sum of digits\n    alternating_sum = 0\n    for i, digit in enumerate(str_num):\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            alternating_sum += int(digit)\n        else:\n            alternating_sum -= int(digit)\n    \n    # A number is divisible by 11 if alternating sum is divisible by 11\n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0"}
