{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Build sequence iteratively up to n\n    seq = [0, 1, 1]  # index 0 unused, seq[1]=1, seq[2]=1\n    \n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        seq.append(seq[seq[i - 1]] + seq[i - seq[i - 1]])\n    \n    return seq[n]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 2:\n        return 1\n    \n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    dp[1] = dp[2] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        dp[i] = dp[dp[i-1]] + dp[i - dp[i-1]]\n    \n    return dp[n]"}
