{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "def eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Returns the Eulerian number A(n,m) using the recurrence relation.\"\"\"\n    if m == 0 or m == n - 1:\n        return 1\n    if m < 0 or m >= n:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Create a table to store computed values\n    table = {}\n    \n    def compute(n, m):\n        if (n, m) in table:\n            return table[(n, m)]\n        \n        if m == 0 or m == n - 1:\n            result = 1\n        elif m < 0 or m >= n:\n            result = 0\n        else:\n            # A(n,m) = (m+1)*A(n-1,m) + (n-m)*A(n-1,m-1)\n            result = (m + 1) * compute(n - 1, m) + (n - m) * compute(n - 1, m - 1)\n        \n        table[(n, m)] = result\n        return result\n    \n    return compute(n, m)"}
