{"task_id": "Mbpp/160", "solution": "def find_solution(a, b, n):\n    def gcd(x, y):\n        while y:\n            x, y = y, x % y\n        return x\n    \n    def extended_gcd(x, y):\n        if y == 0:\n            return x, 1, 0\n        gcd_val, x1, y1 = extended_gcd(y, x % y)\n        x0 = y1\n        y0 = x1 - (x // y) * y1\n        return gcd_val, x0, y0\n    \n    g, x, y = extended_gcd(a, b)\n    if n % g != 0:\n        return None\n    \n    factor = n // g\n    return (x * factor, y * factor)"}
