{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Generate Perrin numbers: P(n) = P(n-2) + P(n-3) with P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 3\n    if n == 2:\n        return 3\n    if n == 3:\n        return 5\n    \n    p0, p1, p2 = 3, 0, 2\n    total = 5  # sum of first 3 numbers\n    \n    for i in range(3, n):\n        next_p = p0 + p1\n        total += next_p\n        p0, p1, p2 = p1, p2, next_p\n    \n    return total"}
