{"task_id": "Mbpp/468", "solution": "def max_product(arr):\n    \"\"\"Find maximum product of an increasing subsequence.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # dp[i] stores the maximum product ending at index i\n    dp = arr[:]\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if arr[j] < arr[i]:\n                dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] * arr[i])\n    \n    return max(dp)"}
