{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "def sum_Of_product(n):\n    \"\"\"Find sum of product of consecutive binomial coefficients.\"\"\"\n    def binomial(n, r):\n        if r > n or r < 0:\n            return 0\n        if r == 0 or r == n:\n            return 1\n        result = 1\n        for i in range(min(r, n - r)):\n            result = result * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n        return result\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        coeff1 = binomial(n, i)\n        coeff2 = binomial(n, i + 1)\n        total += coeff1 * coeff2\n    \n    return total"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "def sum_Of_product(n):\n    \"\"\"Find sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients C(n,r) * C(n,r+1).\"\"\"\n    def binomial_coeff(n, r):\n        if r > n or r < 0:\n            return 0\n        if r == 0 or r == n:\n            return 1\n        result = 1\n        for i in range(min(r, n - r)):\n            result = result * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n        return result\n    \n    total_sum = 0\n    for r in range(n):\n        total_sum += binomial_coeff(n, r) * binomial_coeff(n, r + 1)\n    \n    return total_sum"}
