{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "def wind_chill(velocity, temperature):\n    \"\"\"Calculate wind chill index and round to next integer.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    \n    # Convert velocity from km/h to mph for the formula\n    velocity_mph = velocity * 0.621371\n    \n    # Convert temperature from celsius to fahrenheit\n    temp_f = (temperature * 9/5) + 32\n    \n    # Calculate wind chill in fahrenheit\n    wind_chill_f = 35.74 + (0.6215 * temp_f) - (35.75 * (velocity_mph ** 0.16)) + (0.4275 * temp_f * (velocity_mph ** 0.16))\n    \n    # Convert back to celsius\n    wind_chill_c = (wind_chill_f - 32) * 5/9\n    \n    # Round to next integer (ceiling)\n    return math.ceil(wind_chill_c)"}
