{"task_id": "Mbpp/733", "solution": "def find_first_occurrence(arr, target):\n    \"\"\"Find the index of the first occurrence of target in sorted array.\"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n    \n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            right = mid - 1\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    \n    return result"}
