{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "def toggle_middle_bits(n):\n    \"\"\"Toggle all bits except the first and last bit of the number.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return n\n    \n    # Find the position of the most significant bit\n    msb_pos = n.bit_length() - 1\n    \n    # Create a mask with 1s for all middle bits (excluding MSB and LSB)\n    mask = ((1 << (msb_pos - 1)) - 1) << 1\n    \n    # Toggle the middle bits using XOR\n    return n ^ mask"}
